The three real applications ICDEV[OS]'s modernisation samples are tested on (ICDEV[OS] Phases 253-257,
examples/modernisation/apps.yaml there) are third-party open-source applications. This directory holds only what
ICDEV[IT]'s tools derived from their source, statically and without a model (icx-mdz-03):

    <app>.apptwin.json   the icos-apptwin/v1 bundle (tools/modernization/apptwin_export.py)
    <app>.gaps.json      the run's report: every step, and every section present or missing with why
    <app>.features.json  the features and processes with their evidence and step signatures
                         (tools/modernization/bundle_features.py)

Regenerated with tools/modernization/sample_pipeline.py --no-model on a scratch database, at the commits pinned in
ICDEV[OS]'s apps.yaml, with that file's cloud and AI targets. Nothing in them is hand-filled. Their source is never
committed here.

